{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":484358,"name":"Casti Cimpian","username":"Casti_Cimpian","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/c/ed655f/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-06T05:05:48.251Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484358-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484358-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484358-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484358-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot 0.43.0 stable, Intel Mac (x86_64)\u003cbr\u003e\nError: Couldn’t load conversation / Couldn’t load this conversation. Check your connection and try again.\u003cbr\u003e\nTwo bots (Chief of Staff and Newsletter) original threads fail on desktop. The rest of bots load the chat history fine.\u003cbr\u003e\nSame two threads open on iPhone\u003cbr\u003e\nOther Bots open on this Mac\u003cbr\u003e\nNew group chat with those two Bots also opens on this Mac\u003cbr\u003e\nNetwork OK: api2.cursor.sh HTTP/2 200; \u003ca href=\"http://test.us8.cursorvm.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003etest.us8.cursorvm.com\u003c/a\u003e 404 awselb/2.0\u003cbr\u003e\nAlready tried: Retry, Cmd+Q, sign out/in, cache rename\u003cbr\u003e\nDid not Reset Agent Computer\u003cbr\u003e\nTime: 5 Sep 2026, from ~5:20pm PT through ~7:50pm PT\u003cbr\u003e\nRequest / conversation IDs: 5c11fb2b-ca36-496a-bbc3-56398b7726b8 and  7d08fe9c-1179-4e8d-9df1-f5d7725ae0dc\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484358-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484358-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eopen the conversation IDs: 5c11fb2b-ca36-496a-bbc3-56398b7726b8 and  7d08fe9c-1179-4e8d-9df1-f5d7725ae0dc and see if chat history shows up\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484358-screenshots-screen-recordings-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484358-screenshots-screen-recordings-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/0/c/0c19e4d2946187aa0b9b9de4e70313b758d65998.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/1J3cPt5emQJMZO5jSAZXYHVGXX2.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"Grok_Bot.jpg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/0/c/0c19e4d2946187aa0b9b9de4e70313b758d65998_2_690x498.jpeg\" alt=\"Grok_Bot.jpg\" data-base62-sha1=\"1J3cPt5emQJMZO5jSAZXYHVGXX2\" width=\"690\" height=\"498\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/0/c/0c19e4d2946187aa0b9b9de4e70313b758d65998_2_690x498.jpeg, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/0/c/0c19e4d2946187aa0b9b9de4e70313b758d65998_2_1035x747.jpeg 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/0/c/0c19e4d2946187aa0b9b9de4e70313b758d65998_2_1380x996.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"0F0F0F\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eGrok_Bot.jpg\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e2076×1500 171 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484358-operating-system-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484358-operating-system-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMacOS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484358-version-information-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484358-version-information-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVersion: 0.43.0\u003cbr\u003e\nRelease Track: stable\u003cbr\u003e\nOS: darwin\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484358-for-ai-issues-add-request-id-with-privacy-disabled-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484358-for-ai-issues-add-request-id-with-privacy-disabled-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFor AI issues: add Request ID with privacy disabled\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRequest / conversation IDs: 5c11fb2b-ca36-496a-bbc3-56398b7726b8 and  7d08fe9c-1179-4e8d-9df1-f5d7725ae0dc\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484358-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484358-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2026-09-06T05:14:08.655Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":13,"reads":6,"readers_count":5,"score":66.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":170750,"topic_slug":"cannot-load-chat-history-for-some-grok-bots","display_username":"Casti Cimpian","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"http://test.us8.cursorvm.com","internal":false,"reflection":false,"clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":136391,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/cannot-load-chat-history-for-some-grok-bots/170750/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":484442,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-06T08:35:36.300Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey, thanks for the detailed report and for checking your network. Your connection and the bot computer are both fine.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis is a known issue we’re already tracking. On the 0.43.0 desktop app, a conversation where the bot asked for a secret or credential can stop opening on Mac, while it still opens on iPhone and still shows a preview in the sidebar. That matches exactly what you described for the two bots Chief of Staff and Newsletter. The message Couldn’t load conversation is misleading here. It’s not a connection problem.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA fix has already been rolled out and it’s being applied to each bot computer automatically in the background. You don’t need to do anything on your side. Please don’t update the app, and don’t use Reset Agent Computer or reinstall. It won’t help in this case. Those two conversations should start opening on Mac again within a few hours, and at most within 24 hours. Messages you send from Mac still reach the bots, and the full history is visible on iPhone.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf after 24 hours any of the conversations still won’t open on Mac, reply here and we’ll take another look.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2026-09-06T08:35:36.300Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":5,"readers_count":4,"score":6.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":170750,"topic_slug":"cannot-load-chat-history-for-some-grok-bots","display_username":"Dean Rie","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":750,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/cannot-load-chat-history-for-some-grok-bots/170750/5","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":484570,"name":"Casti Cimpian","username":"Casti_Cimpian","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/c/ed655f/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-06T13:33:50.853Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eThank you! That is exactly was the trigger , bot was waiting for a secret for a long time. After that this issue appeared.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":6,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2026-09-06T13:33:50.853Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":5,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":5,"readers_count":4,"score":46.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":170750,"topic_slug":"cannot-load-chat-history-for-some-grok-bots","display_username":"Casti Cimpian","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"reply_to_user":{"id":750,"username":"deanrie","name":